title: You don't have to keep around old solutions
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

If something got decided one day just because it needed to get decided that day, who cares, you don't have to maintain other people's rash decisions or pragmatic short term solutions... why did it get chosen in the first place?

What should you do instead?

